        "raw": "Personally, how I would build a Hero who makes Constructs would be to have the Hero be a Minion-Maker. Although that only really works if the Character's Constructs continually do stuff without the Hero needing to do anything, and are destroyable. You definitely could go another route and just have your Constructs be represented by your Abilities and Powers, etc.\n\nAnyway, onto your actual question:\n[quote=\"Raziroth, post:1, topic:28900\"]\nIf a character is able to rapidly/instantly change between melee or ranged weapons, should that simply be handled as flavor and have the character use either the Close Combat or Ranged Combat quality with the same damage type?\n[/quote]\nYep, that absolutely works. Although remember that Close Combat and Ranged Combat aren't the only Qualities that you can use to Attack. You could use, e.g., Self-Discipline, Awareness, maybe even Science!\n\n[quote=\"Raziroth, post:1, topic:28900\"]\nCould hard light constructs be considered a Signature Weapon?\n[/quote]\nI'd definitely say so.",
