      {
        "id": 241136,
        "name": "FrivYeti",
        "username": "FrivYeti",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/frivyeti/{size}/1919_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-10-31T17:19:42.402Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For Green Lantern specifically, I would probably consider his Lantern Constructs to be a unique Materials Power, because its effect is to create <em>stuff</em> which he then uses to various great effect. This doesn’t matter a lot compared to using Signature Weapon, except for Red Abilities - Signature Weapon uses the Hallmark abilities, and I think the Materials abilities would fit a bit better. And if it were Green Lantern’s explicitly Willpower-derived constructs, Self-Discipline would make a lot of sense as the usual quality to go with it.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-10-31T17:19:42.402Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
